<codeline><highlight class="normal">#<sp/>Sysctl<sp/>{#DRIVERS_SYSCTL_PAGE}</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">[TOC]</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">System<sp/>Control<sp/>(SysCtl)<sp/>determines<sp/>the<sp/>overall<sp/>operation<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>device.<sp/>The<sp/>API<sp/>provides<sp/>functions<sp/>to<sp/>configure<sp/>the<sp/>clocking<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>device,<sp/>the<sp/>set<sp/>of<sp/>peripherals<sp/>that<sp/>are<sp/>enabled,<sp/>the<sp/>windowed<sp/>watchdog,<sp/>and<sp/>low-power<sp/>modes.<sp/>It<sp/>also<sp/>provides<sp/>functions<sp/>to<sp/>handle<sp/>and<sp/>obtain<sp/>information<sp/>about<sp/>resets<sp/>and<sp/>missing<sp/>clock<sp/>detection<sp/>failures.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>Example<sp/>Usage</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">Include<sp/>the<sp/>below<sp/>file<sp/>to<sp/>access<sp/>the<sp/>APIs</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">#include<sp/>&lt;sysctl.h&gt;</highlight></codeline>
<codeline></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">##<sp/>API</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\ref<sp/>clock_api</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\ref<sp/>sysctl_api</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\cond<sp/>F29H85x</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\ref<sp/>watchdog_api</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">\endcond</highlight></codeline>
